{"data": {"notes": [], "reqs": [{"kind": "contract", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R1", "source": {"type": "task_metadata"}, "status": "active", "text": "Entry point `solve` in language python, within the stated limits.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "hard", "requirement_id": "R2", "source": {"char_end": 378, "char_start": 0, "quote": "The function count_words in wc.py miscounts words when the text has repeated spaces or newlines.\n\nImplement the CORRECT behaviour as `solve(data)`: `data` is a dict with the keys `text` (the arguments of `count_words(text)`), and solve must return what the corrected `count_words` returns.\n\nCurrent implementation (buggy):\ndef count_words(text):\n    return len(text.split(\" \"))\n", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "The program is correct on all legal inputs of the statement.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R3", "source": {"char_end": 424, "char_start": 390, "quote": "Input:\n{\"text\": \"a b c\"}\nOutput:\n3", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 1: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R4", "source": {"char_end": 472, "char_start": 436, "quote": "Input:\n{\"text\": \"a  b\\nc\"}\nOutput:\n3", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 2: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}, {"kind": "explicit", "priority": "functional", "requirement_id": "R5", "source": {"char_end": 513, "char_start": 484, "quote": "Input:\n{\"text\": \"\"}\nOutput:\n0", "type": "request_span"}, "status": "active", "text": "Public example 3: output exactly the quoted output for the quoted input.", "version": 1}], "request_sha": "9828b5615f565e167b2520bff5abe08ea04d7b9ec6dc332bffef38413b53d08a", "stop": null}, "kind": "requirements", "prev": "afe4826e6351856c71e5f97b4362f8ab61